WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
How do you find the area under a curved line?

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.900
Fill it with rectangles. 4 strips give 10.5.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.820
Double to 8 strips: about 13.1.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:15.190
32 strips: about 15.3.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:21.013
Thinner strips hug the curve better and better. The exact area is 16.
